# "Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step" (CR 603.7): the Crystal is activated in Bot1's own end step of turn 3, after that
# step began, so "the next end step" is turn 4's (Bot2's). The token Ornithopter is still there through Bot2's turn 4 up to its end step (the
# check at Bot2's second main phase) and gone after (turn 5), when Bot1's graveyard is still empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
The Fire Crystal
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Mountain
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Fire Crystal.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.The Fire Crystal.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Token = true
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; The Fire Crystal; Ornithopter
